[8H6M69W4] reports 142 folios for No. 15940 (author: blo gros rgyal mtshan; 45 x 7.6 cm) and 117 folios for No. 15939 (author: paNDi ta 'jam dbyangs blo gros kyis; 44 x 9 cm.). &#13;
