On his role in the transmission of the Mūlamadhyamakakārikā (ID:3715) and Prasannapadā (ID:3724) to Tibet, see [LF4HXHGF] (in particular p. 649).</note></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work3749"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ratnagotravibhāga</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rātnagotravibhāga mahāyānottaratantraśāstra</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">uttaratantra</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po rgyud bla ma'i bstan bcos</title><author ref="person:3747">maitreya</author><author ref="person:3756">asaṅga</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">The authorship of the work comes to be ascribed to the future Buddha Maitreya (ID:3747) in the Indian tradition from the 11th c. onward and in the Tibetan tradition. On earlier witnesses ascribing the authorship to Sāramati or Sthiramati, see [BAQ9MH4T]: 20-27. No attribution of that work to Asaṅga (ID:3756) was located in Indian sources, but the colophon of the Tibetan translation by rNgog Blo ldan shes rab ascribes the verses to Maitreya and the prose commentary to Asaṅga ([BAQ9MH4T]: 27-28).&#13;
There are six Tibetan translations, only that by rNgog Blo ldan shes rab and Sajjana is currently extant ([BAQ9MH4T]: chap. 6).</note><idno type="APIS">3749</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4661"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po rgyud bla ma'i bstan bcos kyi rnam bshad nges don rab gsal snang ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཐེག་པ་ཆེན་པོ་རྒྱུད་བླ་མའི་བསྟན་བཅོས་ཀྱི་རྣམ་བཤད་ངེས་དོན་རབ་གསལ་སྣང་བ</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1304-01-01" notAfter="1376-12-31">after 1304 before 1376</date><author ref="person:4128">sa bzang ma ti paN chen blo gros rgyal mtshan</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">[ENNZCF55]: 71, n. 63 discusses the correspondence with an unnumbered entry in [5RXEUKD9].</note><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:3749"/><idno type="APIS">4661</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5487"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po'i mdo sde'i rgyan gyi rnam par bshad pa theg chen rab gsal snang ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཐེག་པ་ཆེན་པོའི་མདོ་སྡེའི་རྒྱན་གྱི་རྣམ་པར་བཤད་པ་ཐེག་ཆེན་རབ་གསལ་སྣང་བ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po'i mdo sde'i rgyan gyi bshad pa theg chen rab gsal snang ba</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1304-01-01" notAfter="1376-12-31">after 1304 before 1376</date><author ref="person:4128">sa bzang ma ti paN chen blo gros rgyal mtshan</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 528, No. 11481: sa bzang 'phags pa blo gros rgyal mtshan gyi mdo sde rgyan gyi rnam bshad theg chen rab gsal snang ba).</note><idno type="APIS">5487</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5491"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dam pa'i chos mngon pa kun las btus pa'i 'grel pa shes bya rab gsal snang ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">དམ་པའི་ཆོས་མངོན་པ་ཀུན་ལས་བཏུས་པའི་འགྲེལ་པ་ཤེས་བྱ་རབ་གསལ་སྣང་བ</title><title type="al